    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/4005d342adf5138b1484f48cdb49fc6d.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/4005d342adf5138b1484f48cdb49fc6d.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organic Burger Simulator is a simulation game where you prepare delicious and healthy burgers using only organic ingredients. Starting from a humble food stand, grow your business and make a difference by offering the highest quality, sustainable burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/7a210a4d633e9dd367b7579bd8a6fa94.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/7a210a4d633e9dd367b7579bd8a6fa94.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Support Local Economy: Select the finest products from local vendors, helping your neighbors thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/9cc2b24885244a0d161988aa4d2919cf.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/9cc2b24885244a0d161988aa4d2919cf.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Farm-to-Table Gameplay: Grow your own vegetables, raise free-range animals, and gather fresh ingredients to create your recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f9a088b4acc7addd1b23eec2b1be19ea.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f9a088b4acc7addd1b23eec2b1be19ea.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Creative Burger Design: Stay ahead of the competition by crafting unique burgers tailored to diverse customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/576c5249a3d0fe1a07e77c9afe6a62eb.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/576c5249a3d0fe1a07e77c9afe6a62eb.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Challenging Management: Balance your budget, upgrade your equipment, and maximize profits while ensuring customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/71b9f29a58b91c43e10ff3d39d1dc507.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/71b9f29a58b91c43e10ff3d39d1dc507.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Eco-Friendly Approach: Adopt sustainable practices, minimize waste, and earn rewards by promoting environmentally friendly habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f3f4e336cb8a9b064384b380d239f1db.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f3f4e336cb8a9b064384b380d239f1db.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this journey to revolutionize the fast-food industry with organic burgers!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/4005d342adf5138b1484f48cdb49fc6d.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/4005d342adf5138b1484f48cdb49fc6d.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organic Burger Simulator is a simulation game where you prepare delicious and healthy burgers using only organic ingredients. Starting from a humble food stand, grow your business and make a difference by offering the highest quality, sustainable burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/7a210a4d633e9dd367b7579bd8a6fa94.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/7a210a4d633e9dd367b7579bd8a6fa94.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Support Local Economy: Select the finest products from local vendors, helping your neighbors thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/9cc2b24885244a0d161988aa4d2919cf.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/9cc2b24885244a0d161988aa4d2919cf.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Farm-to-Table Gameplay: Grow your own vegetables, raise free-range animals, and gather fresh ingredients to create your recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f9a088b4acc7addd1b23eec2b1be19ea.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f9a088b4acc7addd1b23eec2b1be19ea.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Creative Burger Design: Stay ahead of the competition by crafting unique burgers tailored to diverse customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/576c5249a3d0fe1a07e77c9afe6a62eb.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/576c5249a3d0fe1a07e77c9afe6a62eb.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Challenging Management: Balance your budget, upgrade your equipment, and maximize profits while ensuring customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/71b9f29a58b91c43e10ff3d39d1dc507.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/71b9f29a58b91c43e10ff3d39d1dc507.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Eco-Friendly Approach: Adopt sustainable practices, minimize waste, and earn rewards by promoting environmentally friendly habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f3f4e336cb8a9b064384b380d239f1db.poster.avif?t=1752317832\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/f3f4e336cb8a9b064384b380d239f1db.webm?t=1752317832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this journey to revolutionize the fast-food industry with organic burgers!</p>",
